1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,290
(Sheldon:)Remember how Leonard told you
we couldn't come...

2
00:00:02,461 --> 00:00:05,961
(Sheldon:)...because we were attending a symposium
on molecular positronium?

3
00:00:07,633 --> 00:00:10,343
(Penny:)I remember symposium.

4
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:13,470
(Sheldon:)Yes, well, he lied.

5
00:00:14,181 --> 00:00:15,721
(Penny:)Wait, what?

6
00:00:15,891 --> 00:00:19,181
(Sheldon:)He lied, and I'm feeling
very uncomfortable about it.

7
00:00:19,353 --> 00:00:21,393
(Penny:)Well, imagine how I'm feeling.

8
00:00:22,857 --> 00:00:24,147
(Sheldon:)Hungry?

9
00:00:25,651 --> 00:00:27,441
(Sheldon:)Tired?

10
00:00:27,611 --> 00:00:30,321
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry, this really isn't my strong suit.

11
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,370
You told her I lied?

12
00:00:32,533 --> 00:00:34,363
(Leonard:)Why would you tell her I lied?

13
00:00:34,952 --> 00:00:36,872
(Sheldon:)To help you.

14
00:00:37,705 --> 00:00:39,375
(Leonard:)I'm sorry, I'm not seeing the help.

15
00:00:39,540 --> 00:00:41,880
(Sheldon:)She was going to see
through your lie eventually...

16
00:00:42,042 --> 00:00:44,502
(Sheldon:)...so I told her that you were lying
to protect me.

17
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:45,750
[LEONARD GROANS]

18
00:00:45,921 --> 00:00:48,511
(Leonard:)Oh, I'm getting a bad feeling.

19
00:00:48,674 --> 00:00:50,384
(Sheldon:)Hunger?

20
00:00:51,218 --> 00:00:52,218
Indigestion?

21
00:00:52,386 --> 00:00:54,516
(Sheldon:)I'm sorry,
I'm really not very good at this.

22
00:00:54,930 --> 00:00:57,640
(Sheldon:)Anyway, Penny now believes
that on Friday night...

23
00:00:57,808 --> 00:01:03,018
(Sheldon:)...we're going to participate
in my cousin Leopold's drug intervention.

